# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# NOTE: git only treats "#" as a comment at the START of a line. A comment
# written after a pattern becomes part of the pattern, which then matches
# nothing — so every explanation below sits on its own line, above its rule.

# Your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials.
config/api_keys.json
# MCP commands, URLs, and local server credentials.
config/mcp_servers.json
# The dashboard's TLS private key and certificate.
config/certs/
# A LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key.
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets (Gmail / Calendar plugins).
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
# Copies the app sets aside when a config or memory file turns out to be
# unreadable, and the temporary files of an interrupted save. Both can hold
# the same secrets as the originals.
*.corrupt-*
*.json.*.tmp

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# Files sent from the phone when no Downloads/Documents folder is available.
uploads/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
